  "releaseNotes": "5.1.0\n\t\t- Added User Enabled indicator to the user-role matrix.\n\t\t- Added Is Application User indicator to the user-role matrix.\n\n\t\t5.0.2.4\n\t\t- Bug Fix Adding a User Role\n\t\t5.0.2.3\n\t\t- Added the Privilege Discovery Functionality\n\t\t5.0.2.2\n\t\t- Added the Privilege Discovery Functionality\n\t\t5.0.2.1\n\t\t- Added the Privilege Discovery Functionality\n\t\t5.0.1.1\n\t\t- Added: Team Business Unit filter dropdown on the filters toolbar.\n\t\t- Added: Role Business Unit filter dropdown on the filters toolbar.\n\t\t- Added: \"Add User to Owner Team\" button to add a user to an Owner Team.\n\t\t- Changed: Delete button now supports team-inherited roles; shows a confirmation warning that removing a user from an Owner Team will remove all roles inherited from that team.\n\n\t\t5.0.1.0\n\t\t- Compatibility issue fixed.\n\n\t\t5.0.0.3 - Enhancement - San-86-UserView-Enhancement #2\n\t\t- View-based filtering: load only records matching the selected Dataverse view (FetchXml).\n\n\t\t5.0.0.2 - Bug fix.\n\t\t- Fixed: Add User Role failed for users outside the root Business Unit when Modern Business Unit (EnableOwnershipAcrossBusinessUnits) was disabled. The role is now assigned using the user's own Business Unit instead of the root BU.\n\n\t\t5.0.0.1 - Initial release.\n\t\t- Load Users & Roles (Direct + via Owner Teams)\n        - Load Owner Teams Roles\n        - Modernized BU setting status (RecomputeOwnershipAcrossBusinessUnits)\n        - Add User Role / Delete (associate/disassociate)\n        - Filters + Export CSV/Excel + Duplicates",
  "requireLicenseAcceptance": false,
  "summary": "User and Owner Team role matrix for Dataverse / Dynamics 365, including user status and application-user indicators.",
